input:
ADtype
BDtype
CDtype
singleM
singleN
singleK
baseM
baseN
baseK

MTE2-HBM
MTE2-L2
MTE1
CUBE
FIXP-L2
FIXP-Ub
coreNum
Freq

output:
MTE2-A-single-HBM = singleM * singleK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE2-HBM
MTE2-A-single-L2 = singleM * singleK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE2-L2
MTE2-B-single-HBM = singleN * singleK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE2-HBM
MTE2-B-single-L2 = singleN * singleK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE2-L2
MTE1-a-base = baseM * baseK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE1
MTE1-b-base = baseN * baseK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE1
CUBE-single = singleM * singleN * singleK / CUBE
CUBE-base = baseM * baseN * baseK / CUBE
FIXP-single-L2 = singleM * singleN * sizeof(CDtype) / FIXP-L2
FIXP-single-Ub = singleM * singleN * sizeof(CDtype) / FIXP-Ub

举例：
input:
ADtype = bf16
BDtype = bf16
CDtype = bf16
singleM = 128
singleN = 128
singleK = 128
baseM = 128
baseN = 128
baseK = 128

MTE2-HBM = 86B/cycle
MTE2-L2 = 129B/cycle
MTE1 = 256B/cycle
CUBE = 16*16*32B/cycle
FIXP-L2 = 129B/cycle
FIXP-Ub = 256B/cycle
coreNum = 64core
Freq = 1.6GHz

output:
MTE2-A-single-HBM = singleM * singleK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE2-HBM = 381cycle
MTE2-A-single-L2 = singleM * singleK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE2-L2 = 254cycle
MTE2-B-single-HBM = singleN * singleK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE2-HBM = 381cycle
MTE2-B-single-L2 = singleN * singleK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE2-L2 = 254cycle
MTE1-a-base = baseM * baseK * sizeof(ADtype) / MTE1 = 128cycle
MTE1-b-base = baseN * baseK * sizeof(BDtype) / MTE1 = 128cycle
CUBE-single = singleM * singleN * singleK * sizeof(CDtype) / CUBE = 512cycle
CUBE-base = baseM * baseN * baseK / CUBE = 512cycle
FIXP-single-L2 = singleM * singleN * sizeof(CDtype) / FIXP-L2 = 508cycle
FIXP-single-Ub = singleM * singleN * sizeof(CDtype) / FIXP-Ub = 256cycle


flash_attention算子包含query、key、value三个矩阵。三个矩阵的shape信息为：
query.shape = [B,N1,S1,D]，key.shape = [B,N2,S2,D]，value.shape = [B,N2,S2,D]，其中，N1可被N2整除
sparse_mode=3代表attention中的因果注意力机制，假设P矩阵为第一个matmul的结果，即P=Q@K。P.shape = [B,N1,S1,S2]
sparse_mode=3代表，以P矩阵的右下角为顶点，斜向上45度延伸的对角线，对角线下方的部分有效，会参与到后续计算中。
flash_attention算子的cube计算量公式为：flops=B*N1*S1*S2*D*2*(2*S2-S1+1)*S1/2/(S1*S2)
要求生成2条用例，用例中的S1>S2,2条用例cube计算量一致，但是输入矩阵的shape信息不同。